Rocket core: writeback-drain stall, mcycle gated on !cease, PExt/RoCC decode hooks.

RocketCore: stall ID while a long-latency writeback (div/RoCC/vector) is
outstanding, defer interrupts across the vector race, usePExt decode and
RoCCDecodeOpcodes. CSR: mcycle counts unless the core has ceased (instead of
!csr_stall), scalar vstart write priority. ALU/IDecode: opt-in packed-SIMD
(PExt) decode and RoCCDecodeDeclared. BaseTile/Core: hasV true for an
integer-only vector unit (vfLen == 0), usePExt. Generic core fixes carried
from the RiskyBird rocket-chip fork (4023521); the flight timing reads mcycle.

